{{> header title="Important: Default Notice"}}

<tr>
  <td style="padding: 20px {{brand.layout.horizontalPadding}};">
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%">
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          <strong>Customer Number: </strong>%%DCALCULATIONCOMMUNICATIONSL04ACCOUNTREFNOD%%
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          <strong>Total Balance Due: </strong>$<strong> </strong>%%DCALCULATIONCOMMUNICATIONSL37ACCOUNTBALANCED%%
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          Hi %%DCALCULATIONCOMMUNICATIONSL07SALUTATIOND%%,
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          Your service(s) have been disconnected and your contract terminated.
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          You were issued with a final bill made up of the remaining monthly service charges, any outstanding device and/or accessory equipment charges and any termination fees (as applicable) on your contract. 
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          Your final bill remains unpaid and is now 60 days overdue.
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          Please pay the total balance due (shown above) immediately. You can pay using any of the payment methods on this notice.
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          If you have settled your account recently, then thank you, and don't worry about reading on.
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 26px; color: {{brand.colors.headerText}}; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          <strong>Failure to pay the total overdue balance will result in the following:</strong>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 0 0 20px 0;">
            <li style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 8px;">Your account has been referred to one of our authorised debt recovery agents to commence action, which may involve additional costs if a solicitor is engaged to initiate legal action.<br /></li>
            <li style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 8px;">It is our policy to list payment  defaults with Equifax and Experian. A payment default listing on your credit file can remain there for up to 5 years and may affect your ability to obtain future finance or credit; and<br /></li>
            <li style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 8px;">We may sell any unrecovered debt to a debt purchaser who will continue their own recovery process.</li>
          </ul>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          If you are experiencing financial hardship, please call us on %%COLLECTIONS_PHONE_NUMBER%% or email %%FHP_EMAIL%% to discuss your options for assistance. We’re available from 8am to 8pm AEST, Monday to Friday. You can read our Financial Hardship Policy at %%FHP_URL%%.
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          Regards,
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 26px; color: {{brand.colors.headerText}}; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          <strong>The {{brand.displayName}} Collections Team</strong>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          %%HOW_TO_PAY_COMPONENT%%
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          %%PAYMENT_SLIP_COMPONENT%%
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}}; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          %%SECURITY_FOOTER_COMPONENT%%
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </td>
</tr>

<tr>
  <td style="padding: 20px {{brand.layout.horizontalPadding}} 60px;">
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%">
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: {{brand.colors.text}};">
          Thanks,<br>
          Your {{brand.displayName}} Team
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </td>
</tr>

{{> footer}}
